'''Feel the Dance''' (ダンサーズ, ''Dansāzu'', '''Dancers''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (Sm): Cats' health increases by 10%.

